Reject a target context exceeding DFlash's configured positional capacity,
including the fixed bonus-plus-draft query block. Validate before GPU model
execution rather than discovering an out-of-range RoPE index in a request.
Keep the drafter configuration unchanged; explicit larger validated capacities
remain usable. Other speculative methods retain their existing policy.

Kind: fix
What: reject DFlash contexts exceeding the drafter capacity and fixed lookahead
Upstream: HyperQwen issue #405
Cut-against: 0.32.0
Retires-when: upstream validates DFlash positional capacity before inference

